---
// GestaoOrganograma.astro - Sub-view 1: Fluxo deliberativo e organograma institucional
---

<div class="space-y-4 text-[#0A0A0A]">
  <!-- Hero institucional -->
  <div class="cagp-tool-box p-4 space-y-3">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#DFDBD2] pb-2.5 flex-wrap gap-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <i class="bi bi-people-fill text-[#8B1E2D] text-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span class="text-base font-['Oswald'] font-bold uppercase text-[#0A0A0A]">
          Compromisso com a Comunidade Discente
        </span>
        <span class="cagp-badge cagp-badge-red font-mono">
          Mandato Vigente
        </span>
      </div>
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/cagp.ufmg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#8B1E2D] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
        <i class="bi bi-instagram" aria-hidden="true"></i> @cagp.ufmg
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      A gestão do Centro Acadêmico orienta-se pela <strong>escuta discente, impessoalidade e descentralização</strong>. Os membros da diretoria exercem seus mandatos de forma voluntária e democrática, dedicando suas horas extracurriculares à melhoria das condições de ensino, ampliação de oportunidades de estágio e pesquisa, e mediação de demandas com o Colegiado e os departamentos parceiros.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1">
      <a href="mailto:cagp@fafich.ufmg.br" class="cagp-btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs py-1.5 px-3 no-underline">
        <i class="bi bi-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i> Enviar Demanda (cagp@fafich.ufmg.br)
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/cagp.ufmg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cagp-btn-secondary inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs py-1.5 px-3 no-underline">
        <i class="bi bi-camera-reels" aria-hidden="true"></i> Vídeos & Comunicados
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Organograma Estrutural Interativo -->
  <div class="cagp-tool-box p-4 space-y-4">
    <div class="border-b border-[#DFDBD2] pb-2.5 flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="bi bi-diagram-2-fill text-[#8B1E2D] text-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <h3 class="font-['Oswald'] text-base font-bold uppercase text-[#0A0A0A]">
            Organograma Funcional (Regimento de 14/10/2024)
          </h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-0.5">
          Sistema de freios e contrapesos fixado nos Arts. 20 a 40 do Regimento Interno:
        </p>
      </div>
      <span class="cagp-badge cagp-badge-dark font-mono">
        Arts. 20 a 40
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Nível 1: Soberana Assembleia Geral -->
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="w-full max-w-md p-3.5 rounded-[6px] bg-[#8B1E2D] text-white text-center shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#0A0A0A] border-2 border-[#0A0A0A]">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 mb-1">
          <i class="bi bi-people-fill text-sm" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase bg-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[3px] font-bold inline-block">
            Instância Máxima Soberana
          </span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-['Oswald'] text-sm uppercase font-bold tracking-wide">
          Soberana Assembleia Geral
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/90 mt-0.5">
          Totalidade dos estudantes matriculados em Gestão Pública (Arts. 35 a 40)
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Conector vertical -->
      <div class="w-0.5 h-6 bg-[#0A0A0A]"></div>

      <!-- Nível 2: Junta Eleitoral e Presidência -->
      <div class="w-full grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 max-w-xl">
        <div class="cagp-card p-3 bg-white text-center">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 mb-1">
            <i class="bi bi-shield-check text-gray-700" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase bg-gray-200 text-gray-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[3px] font-bold inline-block">
              Fiscalização Plebiscitária
            </span>
          </div>
          <h5 class="font-['Oswald'] text-xs font-bold uppercase text-[#0A0A0A]">
            Junta Eleitoral Permanente
          </h5>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-0.5">
            Controle de lisura eleitoral independente da gestão (Arts. 20 a 23)
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded-[6px] bg-[#0A0A0A] text-white text-center shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#8B1E2D] border-2 border-[#0A0A0A]">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 mb-1">
            <i class="bi bi-bank text-amber-400" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase bg-amber-400 text-black px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[3px] font-bold inline-block">
              Poder Executivo
            </span>
          </div>
          <h5 class="font-['Oswald'] text-xs font-bold uppercase text-white">
            Diretoria da Presidência (DIPRE)
          </h5>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 mt-0.5">
            Presidente • Vice-Presidente • Assessoria Geral (Art. 28)
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Conector vertical -->
      <div class="w-0.5 h-6 bg-[#0A0A0A]"></div>

      <!-- Nível 3: As 6 Diretorias Executivas Subordinadas -->
      <div class="w-full">
        <div class="text-center mb-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-gray-600 font-bold">
            6 Diretorias Executivas Setoriais (Arts. 24 a 34)
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 text-xs">
          <div class="cagp-card p-3 bg-white text-center">
            <i class="bi bi-shield-check text-[#8B1E2D] text-base block mb-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-[#8B1E2D] block text-xs">DIJUR</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0A0A0A] block">Assuntos Jurídicos</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Atas, Legalidade & LAI</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cagp-card p-3 bg-white text-center">
            <i class="bi bi-cash-coin text-[#8B1E2D] text-base block mb-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-[#8B1E2D] block text-xs">DIFI</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0A0A0A] block">Finanças & RREO</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">CNPJ, Caixa & Produtos</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cagp-card p-3 bg-white text-center">
            <i class="bi bi-mortarboard text-[#8B1E2D] text-base block mb-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-[#8B1E2D] block text-xs">DIAC</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0A0A0A] block">Ensino & Pesquisa</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">ACG, PPC & Colegiado</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cagp-card p-3 bg-white text-center">
            <i class="bi bi-diagram-3 text-[#8B1E2D] text-base block mb-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-[#8B1E2D] block text-xs">DIAP</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0A0A0A] block">Articulação Política</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">DA FAFICH, DCE & Fóruns</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cagp-card p-3 bg-white text-center">
            <i class="bi bi-palette text-[#8B1E2D] text-base block mb-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-[#8B1E2D] block text-xs">DICULT</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0A0A0A] block">Cultura & Lazer</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Calouradas & Cineclube</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cagp-card p-3 bg-white text-center">
            <i class="bi bi-broadcast-pin text-[#8B1E2D] text-base block mb-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-[#8B1E2D] block text-xs">DIMAC</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0A0A0A] block">Marketing & Mídias</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Portal, Murais & Redes</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>